  "details": "**Steps to reproduce:**\n\n1. Use an avatar.\n\n2. Update said avatar in Unity.\n\n3. Switch out of the avatar and back into it to refresh it.\n\n**Actual result:**\n\nThe avatar does not update to the latest version. This is only fixed by rejoining the world, but sometimes requires restarting the game entirely.\n\n**Expected result:**\n\nThe avatar updates to the latest version as usual.",
